{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DHQLVKRvmjmuPxoFoLq4bA","type":"tool_result","content":"116:**Reactive region**:\n117-A signal or function in a child-position hole. The server evaluates it\n118-once and wraps its output in `<!--[-->` and `<!--]-->` comment markers;\n119-the browser re-evaluates it and morphs the nodes between the markers,\n120-matching children by `key`, else by position and tag name.\n121-_Avoid_: block, slot, island\n122-\n123-**Mount**:\n124-The browser templater's `mount(container, markup)`. It adopts the\n--\n150:reactive regions, and exports mount.\n151-_Avoid_: template engine, template (that is the HTML element below)\n152-\n153-**Template**:\n154-The native `<template>` HTML element that `render` and `renderList` from\n155-the DOM helpers clone rows from. Unrelated to the templater.\n156-_Avoid_: template string, partial\n157-\n158-**Trusted string**:\n55:child position its output is wrapped in `<!--[-->` and `<!--]-->`\n56:markers, and so are children passed to a component. A function-valued\n58:component children renders the same bytes as before.\n69:`mount(container, markup)` **adopts** existing children: it walks the\n76:host's own markup, only into its marked children range, if any.\n79:markup. Keyed children are matched by `key` and moved; unkeyed children\n101:Comment markers add a few bytes to server output where reactivity is\n\n> microtags@0.0.14 size\n> size-limit\n\n- Adding to empty esbuild project\n✔ Adding to empty esbuild project\n  \n  microtags\n  Size limit: 4.2 kB\n  Size:       4.17 kB with all dependencies, minified and brotlied\n  \n  microtags/htm\n  Size limit: 5 kB\n  Size:       1.44 kB with all dependencies, minified and brotlied\n  \n  microtags/htm (browser)\n  Size limit: 4.6 kB\n  Size:       4.56 kB with all dependencies, minified and brotlied","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e566ad36-7644-415a-8af3-f5e97c46f1bd","uuid":"ecb5e457-4d09-486